            "text": "§l§6C§r§lo§6M§r was created by §c@aitji§r (script) and §9@pickerth-12§r (ideas & design).\n§7Customize the addon below to match your playstyle.\n\n§mChanging settings in-game requires §l§4/reload§r§m or §l§4rejoining the world§r§m to restart the script runtime. This improves performance."
